WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:03.830
<b>When Permet was discovered
within minerals,</b>

00:03.830 --> 00:09.080
<b>its special information-sharing properties
became the basis for all these theories.</b>

00:09.080 --> 00:13.630
<b>Today, it's responsible for controlling
and managing systems of every kind.</b>

00:13.630 --> 00:14.450
<b>Excuse me!</b>

00:15.270 --> 00:17.370
<b>Is it used in the monorail too?</b>

00:17.370 --> 00:18.550
<b>Yes.</b>

00:18.550 --> 00:24.330
<b>Permet links connect all the transit cars
on campus to central dispatch.</b>

00:24.330 --> 00:26.540
<b>This prevents uneven data distribution...</b>

00:33.710 --> 00:36.300
<b>LP041, Suletta Mercury...</b>

00:36.980 --> 00:38.110
<b>Passed.</b>

00:38.110 --> 00:41.310
<b>Suletta seems surprisingly cheerful.</b>

00:41.310 --> 00:45.140
<b>I was worried when she lost
the title of Holder to Guel...</b>

00:45.140 --> 00:47.040
<b>There's no way she's okay.</b>

00:47.040 --> 00:49.250
<b>They took Aerial too, after all.</b>

00:49.250 --> 00:51.500
<b>She must be hurting...</b>

00:51.500 --> 00:53.400
<b>Then there's Ms. Miorine...</b>

00:53.400 --> 00:55.290
<b>For things to end like that...</b>

00:57.410 --> 01:01.660
<b>For today's lunch, I tried making
ramoodles with lots of toppings!</b>

01:02.400 --> 01:03.760
<b>Let's eat!</b>

01:05.150 --> 01:08.010
<b>Suletta, during today's class, you--</b>

01:08.010 --> 01:09.250
<b>Was I cool?</b>

01:09.680 --> 01:10.600
<b>Huh?</b>

01:11.450 --> 01:14.850
<b>Asking a question in class in a cool way.</b>

01:16.000 --> 01:18.190
<b>That was on your wish list too?</b>

01:18.190 --> 01:20.780
<b>I can cross two things off today!</b>

01:21.090 --> 01:22.860
<b>Going to class every day,</b>

01:22.860 --> 01:25.030
<b>and eating lunch with all of you...</b>

01:25.550 --> 01:27.370
<b>is so much fun!</b>

03:03.760 --> 03:06.950
<b>Episode 18</b>

03:05.570 --> 03:06.950
<b>Please!</b>

03:06.950 --> 03:10.300
<b>Our company needs your support!</b>

03:10.300 --> 03:14.670
<b>Your subsidiary merger plan...
Remind me, when it was due?</b>

03:15.110 --> 03:18.370
<b>Financing is pointless
if you can't meet your goals.</b>

03:18.370 --> 03:20.540
<b>Even for the son of Vim Jeturk.</b>

03:23.120 --> 03:24.440
<b>It's no use.</b>

03:24.440 --> 03:26.140
<b>The financiers won't say yes.</b>

03:26.140 --> 03:29.410
<b>They must be thinking
I have no track record...</b>

03:30.590 --> 03:32.220
<b>If you need a track record,</b>

03:32.220 --> 03:36.860
<b>doesn't your company have a new
mobile suit model you haven't announced?</b>

03:37.270 --> 03:38.620
<b>A new model?</b>

03:41.030 --> 03:42.950
<b>A Gundam?!</b>

03:43.360 --> 03:46.630
<b>Our next-generation concept model,
the Schwarzette.</b>

03:46.630 --> 03:50.180
<b>I'd heard my dad
was developing something, but...</b>

03:50.500 --> 03:51.970
<b>You snake!</b>

03:51.970 --> 03:54.710
<b>You can't share Gundam
technology without my consent!</b>

03:55.140 --> 03:57.430
<b>And you, Guel! Why didn't you tell me?!</b>

03:57.430 --> 03:59.120
<b>It's news to me too, okay?!</b>

03:59.120 --> 04:01.810
<b>It was before you acquired us.</b>

04:01.810 --> 04:07.490
<b>He was so insistent that we go
into the drone business together.</b>

04:07.490 --> 04:11.070
<b>And since Shin Sei was at the bottom
of the pecking order...</b>

04:13.380 --> 04:15.270
<b>So? What are you proposing?</b>

04:15.880 --> 04:16.860
<b>That machine...</b>

04:17.450 --> 04:19.910
<b>Why don't you announce
it was developed jointly</b>

04:19.910 --> 04:22.570
<b>between GUND-ARM, Inc. and Jeturk?</b>

04:23.430 --> 04:27.700
<b>Then you can also promote
your union to the rest of the Group.</b>

04:28.520 --> 04:29.700
<b>No can do.</b>

04:30.370 --> 04:35.050
<b>GUND-ARM, Inc. won't be involved
in mobile suit development.</b>

04:35.050 --> 04:39.210
<b>We decided that we'd use Gundam
technology for medical purposes.</b>

04:39.990 --> 04:45.430
<b>To win the presidential race,
you likewise need a track record.</b>

04:45.430 --> 04:50.520
<b>If you want to stick to your principles,
you should use them in your concept.</b>

04:50.520 --> 04:52.770
<b>Please don't forget.</b>

04:52.770 --> 04:54.320
<b>I know.</b>

04:54.320 --> 04:56.520
<b>Now it's my turn to fulfill my promise.</b>

04:57.040 --> 04:58.400
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

04:58.890 --> 05:02.420
<b>Sure, but where are you, anyway?</b>

05:02.420 --> 05:03.740
<b>At Grassley.</b>

05:03.740 --> 05:04.490
<b>What?!</b>

05:04.490 --> 05:06.860
<b>They were eager to chat.</b>

05:07.200 --> 05:09.710
<b>And they insisted on inviting me...</b>

05:10.860 --> 05:12.750
<b>Whaaaa?!</b>

05:15.400 --> 05:17.250
<b>Dr. Winston...</b>

05:17.910 --> 05:18.960
<b>Any progress?</b>

05:19.450 --> 05:23.390
<b>Please give me a little more time
to adjust the programming.</b>

05:23.390 --> 05:26.510
<b>Applying parallel distribution
is your specialty.</b>

05:26.510 --> 05:29.140
<b>We'll continue to rely on you.</b>

05:29.920 --> 05:32.970
<b>What in the world
is the mobile suit in this file?</b>

05:33.630 --> 05:35.270
<b>It's exactly what the specs say.</b>

05:35.820 --> 05:41.110
<b>A GUND-Bit in mobile suit form,
to expand Aerial's data storm network.</b>

05:41.800 --> 05:43.480
<b>It's called a Gundnode.</b>

05:44.810 --> 05:45.990
<b>My cooperation?</b>

05:45.990 --> 05:47.210
<b>Yes.</b>

05:47.210 --> 05:49.130
<b>We'd like to make Shin Sei's
GUND-ARM technology</b>

05:49.130 --> 05:51.080
<b>part of the Group's core business.</b>

05:51.080 --> 05:55.510
<b>Hasn't Grassley been a denier of Gundams?</b>

05:55.510 --> 05:57.720
<b>If we're to quickly restore
our credibility,</b>

05:57.720 --> 06:00.810
<b>we can't afford to be picky
about the means.</b>

06:01.450 --> 06:04.850
<b>I hear you were unable
to recover the Gundam types</b>

06:04.850 --> 06:07.220
<b>used in the attack on the Open Campus...</b>

06:07.580 --> 06:08.420
<b>Yes.</b>

06:08.860 --> 06:12.090
<b>It seems they had built-in
self-destruct protocols.</b>

06:12.090 --> 06:13.440
<b>It's unfortunate...</b>

06:13.440 --> 06:15.060
<b>If you wanted a Gundam,</b>

06:15.060 --> 06:19.660
<b>wouldn't you try to obtain one
even in a damaged state?</b>

06:19.660 --> 06:21.160
<b>Or could it be...</b>

06:21.160 --> 06:24.500
<b>that their recovery would cause
you some inconvenience?</b>

06:27.150 --> 06:28.500
<b>Shaddiq!</b>

06:29.600 --> 06:31.170
<b>Why hello, Miorine.</b>

06:31.170 --> 06:33.280
<b>Glad to see you looking well, Guel.</b>

06:33.280 --> 06:34.550
<b>Shaddiq.</b>

06:34.550 --> 06:37.390
<b>Dealing with Miorine's subsidiary
without her permission...</b>

06:37.390 --> 06:38.730
<b>What are you trying to do?</b>

06:38.730 --> 06:39.830
<b>Canvassing, of course.</b>

06:39.830 --> 06:43.180
<b>I'm enlisting companies
to support my election as president.</b>

06:43.180 --> 06:45.050
<b>You're running, too?</b>

06:45.540 --> 06:49.510
<b>My marriage to you
didn't pan out, after all.</b>

06:50.470 --> 06:51.640
<b>Congratulations on your engagement.</b>

06:52.360 --> 06:56.600
<b>While you were all dueling,
I'd already earned Peil's support.</b>

06:56.600 --> 06:57.780
<b>What?</b>

06:57.780 --> 07:00.280
<b>Your opponents in the presidential race...</b>

07:00.280 --> 07:02.650
<b>are two of the three branches.</b>

07:03.800 --> 07:05.360
<b>The vote is in two weeks.</b>

07:05.850 --> 07:07.360
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

07:08.850 --> 07:12.030
<b>I've checked the temperature
and adjusted sunlight patterns...</b>

07:12.030 --> 07:15.470
<b>Oh wait, the fertilizer! That was close...</b>

07:15.470 --> 07:16.950
<b>Suletta!</b>

07:17.530 --> 07:18.680
<b>Yes?</b>

07:18.680 --> 07:21.790
<b>Aren't you pissed off at Miorine?</b>

07:22.310 --> 07:25.520
<b>She's succeeding the father
she hated so much,</b>

07:25.520 --> 07:29.600
<b>and she threw you aside
for that Jeturk blowhard.</b>

07:29.600 --> 07:31.000
<b>How selfish can she be?</b>

07:32.040 --> 07:34.080
<b>Ms. Miorine did nothing wrong.</b>

07:34.750 --> 07:36.600
<b>What?! But why?!</b>

07:37.290 --> 07:39.110
<b>I'm the one at fault.</b>

07:39.110 --> 07:42.560
<b>I broke my promise to Ms. Miorine.</b>

07:43.590 --> 07:47.990
<b>It was foolish of me to think
I was ever a match for her.</b>

07:48.470 --> 07:50.630
<b>How long are you going to
hang around here?</b>

07:50.630 --> 07:51.920
<b>You creeps...</b>

07:51.920 --> 07:55.950
<b>Both Miorine and the title of Holder
belong to my brother now.</b>

07:56.240 --> 07:57.870
<b>Nobody needs you any more.</b>

07:58.490 --> 08:00.750
<b>You empty Mercurian wench.</b>

08:01.450 --> 08:03.430
<b>Watch your mouth!</b>

08:03.430 --> 08:04.930
<b>I've no intention of fighting you.</b>

08:04.930 --> 08:05.540
<b>What'd you say?!</b>

08:05.540 --> 08:07.480
<b>Chuatury Panlunch.</b>

08:07.480 --> 08:09.550
<b>You saved me during the Open Campus.</b>

08:09.550 --> 08:10.850
<b>Thank you.</b>

08:15.380 --> 08:16.600
<b>Thanks!</b>

08:18.500 --> 08:20.970
<b>That's got nothing
to do with this, damn it!</b>

08:21.720 --> 08:23.350
<b>Mr. Lauda is right.</b>

08:24.240 --> 08:27.290
<b>Though I never had anything to begin with,</b>

08:27.290 --> 08:29.610
<b>I called myself the Holder, and the groom.</b>

08:31.680 --> 08:33.280
<b>It was all a mistake.</b>

08:34.240 --> 08:36.450
<b>Why didn't I realize it before now?</b>

08:39.770 --> 08:41.290
<b>You know that's not true.</b>

08:43.320 --> 08:44.970
<b>Ms. Chuchu, what are you--</b>

08:45.830 --> 08:46.960
<b>Let's go...</b>

08:46.960 --> 08:49.180
<b>to see Miorine.</b>

08:51.830 --> 08:53.280
<b>To the head office?!</b>

08:53.280 --> 08:54.920
<b>We're going to meet with Miorine.</b>

08:54.920 --> 08:56.400
<b>Martin, you hold the fort.</b>

08:56.400 --> 08:58.370
<b>Feed the animals too.</b>

08:58.370 --> 09:00.850
<b>W-Wait a second! All of you are going too?</b>

09:01.070 --> 09:02.930
<b>Someone has to helm the ship.</b>

09:02.930 --> 09:05.190
<b>You're still injured, right?</b>

09:05.410 --> 09:09.160
<b>If no one stays behind,
we might get vandalized again!</b>

09:09.160 --> 09:12.460
<b>Staying active takes our minds
off of things, right?</b>

09:12.460 --> 09:13.990
<b>Ms. Chuchu!</b>

09:13.990 --> 09:16.110
<b>I'm fine, really.</b>

09:16.340 --> 09:19.010
<b>I've already accepted that Ms. Miorine--</b>

09:19.010 --> 09:19.660
<b>Shut up.</b>

09:19.660 --> 09:20.380
<b>Ow!</b>

09:20.380 --> 09:21.590
<b>Listen!</b>

09:21.590 --> 09:24.290
<b>It's wrong that you're pretending
you're okay with it!</b>

09:25.120 --> 09:27.660
<b>Tell Miorine straight out
what's on your mind!</b>

09:27.660 --> 09:29.650
<b>I won't accept anything less!</b>

09:30.140 --> 09:31.120
<b>Right...</b>

09:31.120 --> 09:33.560
<b>It's settled, then!</b>

09:34.330 --> 09:35.790
<b>Let's go, Ms. Suletta!</b>

09:37.050 --> 09:38.390
<b>Can't you just talk on the phone?</b>

09:38.610 --> 09:40.350
<b>You've changed, Chuchu.</b>

09:40.350 --> 09:41.190
<b>Huh?</b>

09:41.190 --> 09:44.060
<b>You've always chosen fists
over talking things out...</b>

09:44.060 --> 09:45.430
<b>What happened, huh?</b>

09:46.580 --> 09:49.340
<b>I thought about what Nika would do.</b>

09:50.510 --> 09:53.660
<b>When those Jeturk punks
thanked me earlier,</b>

09:53.660 --> 09:57.590
<b>I think I finally understood
how Nika feels.</b>

09:58.110 --> 10:00.480
<b>So, anyway... we're off.</b>

10:00.480 --> 10:03.120
<b>If the bullies come back,
don't try anything crazy.</b>

10:06.840 --> 10:08.330
<b>What are you drawing, eh?</b>

10:08.570 --> 10:11.170
<b>Why should I tell you?</b>

10:11.170 --> 10:13.920
<b>If you think I'm a threat, don't worry.</b>

10:13.920 --> 10:17.440
<b>When it comes to Grassley
and the Dawn of Fold being connected...</b>

10:17.440 --> 10:19.430
<b>I haven't breathed a word to anyone else.</b>

10:19.990 --> 10:22.540
<b>Despite how I look,
I'm pretty tight-lipped.</b>

10:22.540 --> 10:23.080
<b>Excuse me!</b>

10:23.080 --> 10:23.470
<b>Huh?</b>

10:23.690 --> 10:26.650
<b>You are Mr. Elan, aren't you?</b>

10:26.650 --> 10:29.010
<b>You seem so different--</b>

10:29.010 --> 10:29.940
<b>I'm a different person.</b>

10:29.940 --> 10:30.440
<b>What?</b>

10:30.660 --> 10:33.270
<b>I'm not the Elan Ceres you all knew.</b>

10:34.120 --> 10:37.860
<b>You should have nominated me
as a presidential candidate.</b>

10:38.110 --> 10:40.740
<b>The Peil Grade rendered its judgment.</b>

10:40.740 --> 10:43.990
<b>It's not yet time
for you to take the stage.</b>

10:43.990 --> 10:45.450
<b>An evaluation system?</b>

10:45.880 --> 10:50.640
<b>Peil uses its own unique AI
to select the company's leaders.</b>

10:51.070 --> 10:54.350
<b>The one who received the top grade...</b>

10:54.350 --> 10:56.460
<b>was the real Master Elan Ceres.</b>

10:57.120 --> 11:01.400
<b>But when these stupid
bride-catching games began,</b>

11:01.400 --> 11:05.400
<b>he needed a backup
who could pilot a mobile suit.</b>

11:05.400 --> 11:08.410
<b>In order to win duels?</b>

11:08.410 --> 11:09.430
<b>There was that...</b>

11:09.700 --> 11:14.080
<b>but also, we were initially guinea pigs
used to master Gundam technology.</b>

11:15.290 --> 11:18.710
<b>Pilots implanted with resistance
to data storms.</b>

11:18.710 --> 11:20.580
<b>That's us, the Enhanced Persons.</b>

11:21.250 --> 11:23.070
<b>We still can't help dying, though...</b>

11:23.680 --> 11:25.780
<b>Then, if you pilot the Pharact...</b>

11:25.780 --> 11:26.540
<b>I'll die.</b>

11:28.130 --> 11:30.040
<b>Anyone who pilots a Gundam will.</b>

11:30.790 --> 11:34.430
<b>The odd ones here
are that Mercurian girl and her Aerial.</b>

11:34.430 --> 11:36.500
<b>Tell me, what the hell are those two?</b>

11:36.850 --> 11:39.090
<b>You sure know how to run your mouth.</b>

11:39.310 --> 11:41.730
<b>There's no use hiding it now.</b>

11:41.730 --> 11:45.900
<b>What about you? Is there any reason
for you to pilot a Gundam?</b>

11:45.900 --> 11:46.580
<b>None.</b>

11:46.580 --> 11:47.220
<b>Really?</b>

11:47.450 --> 11:49.110
<b>I said I have none.</b>

11:51.290 --> 11:52.520
<b>I see.</b>

11:52.520 --> 11:56.900
<b>You're hollow inside, so you tell yourself
it's for the Earthians' sake.</b>

11:57.820 --> 11:58.780
<b>Whoopsie!</b>

12:02.320 --> 12:05.710
<b>I want to kill every
last one of you Spacians.</b>

12:05.710 --> 12:07.950
<b>What other reason do I need?</b>

12:07.950 --> 12:10.630
<b>You don't really want
to pilot a Gundam either, do you?</b>

12:10.630 --> 12:11.680
<b>Shut your mouth!</b>

12:12.250 --> 12:16.580
<b>Let's be honest with each other.
Since both our lives are so cheap.</b>

12:17.130 --> 12:19.250
<b>All of them?</b>

12:19.520 --> 12:20.450
<b>Yes.</b>

12:20.450 --> 12:23.940
<b>Hurry with due diligence
on every facility on that list.</b>

12:23.940 --> 12:26.550
<b>Aren't we selling these off
far too cheaply?</b>

12:26.820 --> 12:29.360
<b>That's not as important as
my father's life.</b>

12:29.360 --> 12:31.680
<b>The Earth companies
on the list are first priority.</b>

12:33.300 --> 12:36.400
<b>The transfer of the Group's businesses
seems to be going well.</b>

12:36.840 --> 12:39.980
<b>No one within the companies
suspects a thing.</b>

12:40.400 --> 12:42.680
<b>I'll file a report
with the Space Assembly League.</b>

12:43.360 --> 12:45.070
<b>He's way ahead of us.</b>

12:45.560 --> 12:49.300
<b>It seems he's already gained
considerable support.</b>

12:49.300 --> 12:51.950
<b>I expected Shaddiq would make a bold move,</b>

12:52.390 --> 12:54.760
<b>but not that he'd team up with Peil.</b>

12:54.760 --> 12:57.540
<b>I wonder if this will give you
any hints, but...</b>

12:58.290 --> 13:01.760
<b>Though these initially looked like
protests by demonstrators,</b>

13:01.760 --> 13:06.300
<b>armed Earthian groups have begun
attacking Benerit Group facilities.</b>

13:06.300 --> 13:08.590
<b>The use of heavy weapons
has been confirmed...</b>

13:08.590 --> 13:09.660
<b>Riots?</b>

13:08.590 --> 13:11.620
<b>with both sides suffering losses.</b>

13:09.660 --> 13:12.070
<b>They're protesting
the lack of corporate governance</b>

13:11.620 --> 13:14.350
<b>This now appears to be a civil war.</b>

13:12.070 --> 13:13.390
<b>regarding this terrorism.</b>

13:14.350 --> 13:16.560
<b>It was enforcing unfair security measures</b>

13:14.350 --> 13:21.690
<b>Explosions continue to be heard
 and refugees line the streets.</b>

13:16.560 --> 13:19.230
<b>in the name of criminal investigation.</b>

13:20.250 --> 13:23.810
<b>Their anger... won't be ended by violence.</b>

13:25.190 --> 13:28.660
<b>In that case, why don't we try ending it?</b>

13:28.880 --> 13:29.910
<b>What?</b>

13:29.910 --> 13:32.220
<b>We'll speak directly to the protesters.</b>

13:32.220 --> 13:34.790
<b>If we can calm them down,
that'll be our track record.</b>

13:34.790 --> 13:36.400
<b>You want to go to Earth?!</b>

13:36.400 --> 13:38.000
<b>Naturally.</b>

13:38.000 --> 13:40.540
<b>You'll be talking to armed people.</b>

13:40.810 --> 13:43.670
<b>If you don't make a show of force,</b>

13:43.670 --> 13:46.190
<b>you can't negotiate on even terms.</b>

13:49.040 --> 13:49.800
<b>Then...</b>

13:50.300 --> 13:52.140
<b>We'll use Aerial.</b>

13:52.480 --> 13:53.670
<b>Aerial?</b>

13:54.240 --> 13:58.280
<b>We'll follow school regulations
and won't bring weapons.</b>

13:58.280 --> 14:00.810
<b>I won't let another Plant Quetta happen.</b>

14:01.400 --> 14:04.070
<b>It will provide
a concept of our principles.</b>

14:04.930 --> 14:07.670
<b>We'll demonstrate through this negotiation</b>

14:07.670 --> 14:10.410
<b>that I and GUND-ARM, Inc...</b>

14:10.410 --> 14:13.240
<b>that the Benerit Group of the future...</b>

14:13.240 --> 14:17.120
<b>will save lives without fighting.</b>

14:19.160 --> 14:19.960
<b>To Earth?</b>

14:20.650 --> 14:23.600
<b>They intend to bring
the Quinharbor riots to an end.</b>

14:24.800 --> 14:27.470
<b>Mr. Guel is awesome, right?</b>

14:27.690 --> 14:30.410
<b>He reclaimed the title of Holder
right after re-enrolling.</b>

14:30.410 --> 14:31.850
<b>Now I hear he's going to Earth...</b>

14:32.100 --> 14:34.710
<b>I wish he'd been
the leader from the beginning.</b>

14:34.710 --> 14:36.720
<b>When you've got it, you've got it.</b>

14:36.720 --> 14:38.630
<b>And you've got nothing, right?</b>

14:38.630 --> 14:39.680
<b>Shut up.</b>

14:44.140 --> 14:45.410
<b>Excuse me!</b>

14:45.780 --> 14:48.330
<b>I'm trying to get to my drop-off point.</b>

14:48.330 --> 14:49.820
<b>Can you help me find my way?</b>

14:50.080 --> 14:51.260
<b>Where are you headed?</b>

14:51.260 --> 14:53.200
<b>Hangar 78.</b>

14:54.520 --> 14:55.740
<b>That number is...</b>

14:56.330 --> 15:01.210
<b>It's the one you at Shin Sei
always request at Plant Quetta.</b>

15:03.040 --> 15:06.770
<b>Do you mind if we have a word?</b>

15:08.150 --> 15:13.640
<b>I learned my friend was...
committing a crime and turned her in.</b>

15:14.420 --> 15:16.400
<b>A crime is a crime.</b>

15:16.400 --> 15:19.990
<b>As head of the House,
I wanted to protect everyone!</b>

15:19.990 --> 15:21.060
<b>I've done nothing wrong!</b>

15:21.660 --> 15:24.130
<b>I did the right thing, didn't I?</b>

15:24.960 --> 15:25.610
<b>Huh?</b>

15:27.690 --> 15:29.600
<b>Whoa!</b>

15:30.290 --> 15:31.110
<b>You...</b>

15:31.680 --> 15:34.350
<b>You're a double-crossing
little rat, aren't you?</b>

15:35.680 --> 15:39.160
<b>I believe I advised you
to use your own judgment.</b>

15:39.160 --> 15:41.870
<b>And we've decided.
Got a problem with that?</b>

15:43.090 --> 15:47.540
<b>I'd like to have some of my men
join you for your own security.</b>

15:48.580 --> 15:51.720
<b>Dominicus commander Kenanji Avery,
at your service!</b>

15:51.940 --> 15:53.510
<b>Commander Kenanji?!</b>

15:53.510 --> 15:55.480
<b>Yes. Something wrong?</b>

15:55.480 --> 15:57.830
<b>Oh, uh... nothing.</b>

15:57.830 --> 15:59.490
<b>Thank you for your assistance.</b>

15:59.490 --> 16:00.480
<b>The pleasure is mine.</b>

16:00.700 --> 16:04.100
<b>Well, well... you're not like
your no-nonsense father.</b>

16:06.310 --> 16:09.440
<b>We told you, we want to see Miorine.</b>

16:09.810 --> 16:11.610
<b>Do you have an appointment?</b>

16:11.830 --> 16:14.860
<b>Why do we need an appointment
to meet with our buddy?!</b>

16:14.860 --> 16:17.360
<b>Maybe we should just
turn in an application...</b>

16:18.720 --> 16:20.120
<b>Suletta is here?</b>

16:20.560 --> 16:22.120
<b>What should we do?</b>

16:26.240 --> 16:27.560
<b>Eri?</b>

16:29.240 --> 16:31.130
<b>Go get 'er!</b>

16:32.830 --> 16:34.970
<b>Why does she need a normal suit, though?</b>

16:35.190 --> 16:36.530
<b>Who knows...</b>

16:39.770 --> 16:42.590
<b>What's Ms. Miorine doing here?</b>

16:49.540 --> 16:51.000
<b>Aerial!</b>

16:51.400 --> 16:53.110
<b>Why are you here?</b>

16:55.580 --> 16:57.960
<b>Can I... come inside?</b>

17:07.630 --> 17:08.910
<b>Everyone!</b>

17:11.170 --> 17:15.430
<b>I thought I'd never see you again...</b>

17:16.090 --> 17:19.960
<b>Ms. Miorine said
she didn't need me anymore.</b>

17:20.700 --> 17:25.440
<b>No, it can't be helped.
I'm the one who broke our promise.</b>

17:27.130 --> 17:30.480
<b>I've moved forward. Like Mom says...</b>

17:31.700 --> 17:32.700
<b>But...</b>

17:33.400 --> 17:34.780
<b>I don't know what to do...</b>

17:35.530 --> 17:37.330
<b>I'm not the Holder anymore,</b>

17:37.330 --> 17:39.590
<b>and I don't have to duel.</b>

17:39.590 --> 17:41.520
<b>I study with my friends,</b>

17:41.520 --> 17:44.580
<b>and we can chat together over lunch.</b>

17:45.230 --> 17:47.970
<b>But even then, with Ms. Miorine gone...</b>

17:47.970 --> 17:50.790
<b>it hurts not being able to see her.</b>

17:52.190 --> 17:54.390
<b>"Move forward, gain two..."</b>

17:54.390 --> 17:55.010
<b>Right now...</b>

17:56.090 --> 17:57.280
<b>I can't believe that.</b>

18:18.580 --> 18:20.070
<b>Where am I?</b>

18:25.540 --> 18:28.750
<b>Mercurian year 154, day 63.</b>

18:29.430 --> 18:32.050
<b>Today's game was "DiggingKing."</b>

18:32.050 --> 18:34.380
<b>I won with a score of six to four.</b>

18:35.150 --> 18:38.480
<b>You cried, wanting a rematch...</b>

18:38.480 --> 18:42.510
<b>so Mom gave you hot cocoa
and one honey-flavored candy.</b>

18:44.500 --> 18:45.520
<b>Aerial?</b>

18:45.740 --> 18:48.910
<b>My heating unit was broken
from the solar storms,</b>

18:48.910 --> 18:53.330
<b>so you took your half-empty mug
and held it to my cockpit.</b>

18:53.330 --> 18:55.580
<b>You said it would warm me.</b>

18:55.580 --> 18:57.100
<b>You're Aerial, aren't you?</b>

18:57.100 --> 18:58.260
<b>Why do you look like me...?</b>

18:58.260 --> 18:59.490
<b>The door has opened.</b>

19:01.930 --> 19:03.990
<b>We don't need the key anymore.</b>

19:04.670 --> 19:06.880
<b>Everyone? "Key"?</b>

19:06.880 --> 19:09.250
<b>The key is you, Suletta.</b>

19:09.730 --> 19:13.670
<b>Eri can only live inside the data storm,
so you filled in for her.</b>

19:14.150 --> 19:16.500
<b>Eri has no physical form,
so you filled in for her.</b>

19:16.960 --> 19:22.640
<b>Eri's body, her arms and legs,
her extended consciousness...</b>

19:22.640 --> 19:25.690
<b>That's us, the Children of the Coven.</b>

19:26.510 --> 19:27.310
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:27.660 --> 19:29.010
<b>Filled in for her?</b>

19:29.010 --> 19:34.230
<b>You're all repli-children
created from my genes.</b>

19:35.290 --> 19:37.830
<b>17 years ago, when Mom...</b>

19:37.830 --> 19:39.460
<b>Don't you remember?</b>

19:39.460 --> 19:40.900
<b>But it's fine now.</b>

19:41.170 --> 19:45.120
<b>Quiet Zero will create
a world where Eri can live!</b>

19:45.120 --> 19:48.670
<b>So we don't need you anymore, Suletta!</b>

19:48.670 --> 19:51.130
<b>No... You're wrong...</b>

19:51.130 --> 19:52.230
<b>After all, I...</b>

20:31.440 --> 20:32.460
<b>Do you understand?</b>

20:33.120 --> 20:36.550
<b>At score eight,
I can move of my own free will.</b>

20:37.270 --> 20:39.660
<b>I'll no longer need a pilot.</b>

20:41.230 --> 20:41.920
<b>No...</b>

20:42.470 --> 20:43.810
<b>And that's why</b>

20:43.810 --> 20:45.990
<b>you can't cling to me anymore--</b>

20:45.990 --> 20:48.230
<b>No! Stop! Wait a minute!</b>

20:48.230 --> 20:50.520
<b>Not to me, or to Mom.</b>

20:50.520 --> 20:51.470
<b>Aerial!</b>

21:08.930 --> 21:09.880
<b>Suletta...</b>

21:11.880 --> 21:14.040
<b>Mom?</b>

21:14.990 --> 21:17.020
<b>It's not true, is it?</b>

21:17.020 --> 21:19.920
<b>Is something wrong with Aerial?</b>

21:20.520 --> 21:22.020
<b>No...</b>

21:23.080 --> 21:24.840
<b>It's just as Ericht said.</b>

21:26.970 --> 21:29.600
<b>Go back to the school, Suletta.</b>

21:30.560 --> 21:33.920
<b>It has all you need to fill your heart.</b>

21:51.990 --> 21:53.700
<b>Are you sure about this, Eri?</b>

21:54.650 --> 21:56.900
<b>What if she came with us...?</b>

22:00.770 --> 22:01.600
<b>You're right.</b>

22:01.990 --> 22:05.170
<b>Suletta deserves to live freely,
doesn't she?</b>

23:53.920 --> 24:01.960
<b>Episode 19</b>

23:54.100 --> 23:58.180
<b>Next time on
Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:58.180 --> 23:59.990
<b>"Not the Best Way."</b>

24:01.960 --> 24:07.250
<b>Illustration: redjuice</b>
